Payloads
--------
Every prompt-injection payload shipped with tracebait is original work written for
this project. No payload text is copied from papers, datasets or other tools.

Third-party data
----------------
Incident packs under src/tracebait/data/packs/ will contain small, attributed slices of
public security datasets. Each pack's source, licence and upstream commit will be listed
here when the pack is added.

Field limits in src/tracebait/data/fields.json are facts collected from public
documentation; each entry lists its sources.
